	| Type        | Team                               |
	And I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for teams |
	| Name        | Optional Team Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                                |
	And I create a team with the name "Development Team" for the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	And I assign contacts with the following email addresses to the team "Development Team"
	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	And I assign the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on the team "Development Team" to the following roles	
	| Default Team Role  |
	| Optional Team Role |
	Then the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the team "Development Team" should have the contact role "Default Team Role"
	And the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the team "Development Team" should have the contact role "Optional Team Role"
	And the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the team "Development Team" should have the contact role "Member"

